    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41103" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-nĕo</span></b> ,
		ēre, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to unspin</i>, i. e. <i>to undo</i>, <i>unravel</i> what had
			been spun (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">at Clymenus Clothoque dolent, haec fila reneri,</span>”
				i. e. <i>that the destiny is reversed</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					6, 757</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Parcarum fila,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 3, 1, 171</span></i>
			 (dub.); cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fila manu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Albin.
					1, 444</span></i>
			.</div>
